  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Workshop RBM med turkiska partners</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop RBM with Turkish Partners - Translation for RBM exercise</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med avropet &#xe4;r att genom f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad dialog mellan Sveriges Ambassad i Turkiet och dess turkiska partnerorganisationer st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten g&#xe4;llande RBM.

Uppdragsbeskrivning och NIRAS Indevelops svar p&#xe5; avropsf&#xf6;rfr&#xe5;gan bifogas detta beslut.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the call-off is to strengthen the capacity of the Embassy of Sweden in Turkey and its partner organisations to apply RBM through improved dialogue between the Embassy and its partners. 

Terms of Reference and response to the call-off from NIRAS Indevelop for the assignement is attached to this decision.</narrative>
  </description>
